 125:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c **** 
 126:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c **** 
